{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"agent_message","text":"\n\nAll 3 tests pass. Here's a summary of the fixes:\n\n**`replay/merge.py`** — Two bugs repaired:\n1. **Tool-output identity**: `_event_key` was grouping `tool_output` events by `(role, tool_name)`, causing distinct tool calls with the same name to collide. Now uses `event_id` for stable identity.\n2. **Post-completion debug fragments**: Were marked `after_completion=True` but never removed, so they leaked through to render. Now properly dropped from both `by_key` and `merged` during the merge step.\n\n**`replay/incident_summary.py`** — Now counts directly from merged events (`\"merged_events\"`) instead of parsing rendered lines (`\"rendered_lines\"`).\n\n**`reports/incidents/transcript-merge.md`** — Updated to document the resolution."}}
